  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 9405.01 Annual Certification",
  "priorExpiration": "2023-07-30",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 9405.01 Annual Certification.\n\n(a) An owner of a tow business on the division tow list shall complete and submit form DSSP 458, “New Hampshire State Police Tow List Annual Certification”, revised 01/2023, on or before January 15 of each year.\n\n(b) The owner shall sign the completed DSSP 458, revised 01/2023 under penalty for unsworn falsification pursuant to RSA 641:3. By doing so, the signatory shall certify that it has conducted an internal inspection of the tow business and its employees and that the business is in compliance with the provisions of RSA 106-B:26 et. seq. and these rules.\n\n(c) The DSSP 458, revised 01/2023, may be submitted by email at nhsptowlist@dos.nh.gov, or by mail to the following address:\n\nNew Hampshire State Police\n\nATTN: State Police Communications Commander\n\n33 Hazen Drive\n\nConcord, N.H. 03305.\n\nSource. #13550, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 1-31-23, EXPIRES: 7-30-23; ss by #13653, eff 5-26-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c9400.html"
